{"id":"medium-011","difficulty":"medium","title":"多数元素","description":"出现次数超过 n/2 的元素。","function_signature":"def majority_element(nums: list) -> int","entry_point":"majority_element","constraints":"1 <= len <= 5*10^4","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)"},"required_edge_cases":["单元素"],"public_tests":[{"args":[[3,2,3]],"expected":3},{"args":[[2,2,1,1,1,2,2]],"expected":2},{"args":[[1]],"expected":1}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[[1,1,1,2,2]],"expected":1},{"args":[[0,0,1]],"expected":0}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"Boyer-Moore","复杂度分析":"时间 O(n)，空间 O(1)。","关键边界与处理策略":"保证存在","代码实现":"```python\ndef majority_element(nums: list) -> int:\n    cand,cnt=None,0\n    for x in nums:\n        if cnt==0: cand=x\n        cnt+=1 if x==cand else -1\n    return cand\n```","自测说明":"通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":true,"process_valid":true,"first_error_step":null,"error_types":[],"note":"正确对照样本"},"language":"python"}